<title>USA: U.S. Stockpile sells antimony, no cadmium offers.</title>
<headline>U.S. Stockpile sells antimony, no cadmium offers.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Defense National Stockpile Center said it sold 616,000 pounds of antimony to Amalgamated Metal for an estimated provisional value of $650,000.</p>
<p>Stockpile received no offers for cadmium.</p>
<p>The next offer of cadmium and antimony will be May 13.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1646))</p>
